<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36729" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξᾰναγκάζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					212
				</span></i>
			:—<i>force</i> or <i>compel utterly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ δρᾶν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					620
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1665
			</span></i>, etc.: with the inf. omitted, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				603
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				377
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>force out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕδρην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Haem.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>enforce,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ταγὸν . . ἐξξανακάδην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					9(2).257
				</span></i>
			 (Thess., <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>drive away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀργίαν πληγαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.1.16
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
